WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
GPT File System carries original context and provenance.
.GPT is the proposed logical format; GPTFS is a working reference.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.000
Open the synthetic notebook. The browser independently checks
byte hashes, object identities, relationships, and the event chain.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.000
A derived note links back to the original observation.
Content and its relationships remain inspectable.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
Imported skill text is data. The recorded skill admission is denied,
and shell.exec is outside the allowed capability scope.

00:30.000 --> 00:38.000
Change one byte while retaining its claimed identity.
The independent integrity check detects the mismatch.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
Reset the demo to restore the original snapshot.
Its hashes and history verify again.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Local snapshots stay in browser memory. Integrity checks do not
evaluate authority. Independent policy replay and revocation are next.
